 "remarks": "2475 Summer Street is the perfect blend of inviting atmosphere, comfort, and convenience. Discover this charming, garden style 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom first floor end unit apartment, located in the picturesque Colonial Gardens complex.  This inviting apartment features ample closet space throughout, and lovely details, such as crown molding and reserved parking. Heat and hot water are included, on-site laundry, adding ease and value. Located adjacent to Ridgeway Plaza, as well as within walking distance to the restaurants, shops, nightlife, Downtown Stamford, close to parks, major highways and more. Come see why 2475 Summer Street should be your new home. Agent related to Owner.",
